Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:08.86,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,The Grand Reverse is continuing \Nto plasmify the hyperon bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:11.20,Default,Nanbu,0,0,0,,It's still active.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.33,Default,Shinohara,0,0,0,,How long before it blows?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.58,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:18.29,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,The detonation signal's already being sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:22.79,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,Some of the Dezarium are \Ndoing their best to block it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.15,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,but there's no telling how long they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,There must be a way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:29.09,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Can we cut off the detonation signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:32.60,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,We don't have a way to interfere \Nwith bio-communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:38.94,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,To stop it, we'd have to physically destroy the \Ncontrol system on the Dezarium home planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:44.39,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,If the Yamato is there, \Nmaybe they could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.03,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,But we have no way to contact them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:01:02.78,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,Sasha… Sasha Iscandar Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:03.84,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.63,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,I want to ask you to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:10.17,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,Something only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:14.39,Default,Serizawa,0,0,0,,Director, it may not help,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:18.17,Default,Serizawa,0,0,0,,but we should evacuate the citizens of the \Nnew capital into the old underground cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.17,0:01:21.81,Default,Todo,0,0,0,,I'd love to, but we don't\Nhave the authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:25.18,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,No. Give the whole army the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:28.28,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,You've officially been restored \Nto your position as director.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:32.51,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,Your sister appears to have \Nprepared for this in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:35.57,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,In an emergency, \Nyou were to be her successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.55,Default,Nagakura,0,0,0,,Watch out for the rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:43.48,Default,Nagakura,0,0,0,,Get to the nearest underground entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:45.45,Default,Nagakura,0,0,0,,The battle is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.45,Default,Nagakura,0,0,0,,This evacuation is just a precaution!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.22,Default,Nagakura,0,0,0,,Remain calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:53.06,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry! They say \Nthe Grand Reverse is gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:56.98,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,This is why I said we couldn't \Ntrust the Dezarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:00.52,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:01.86,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Dezarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.86,0:02:03.27,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:05.77,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Frulul! Frulul!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:08.96,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here together! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.43,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,Tsubasa…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:12.76,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.40,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:19.12,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,My new Mother told me…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:22.28,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,to be who I wanted to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:26.80,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,She says even if we were artificially created, \Nbut we can be anything we want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:30.30,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna stay here a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.01,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,'Cause I want to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:36.76,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,And your mom, \Nand your grandpa, and everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.90,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,She says humans can try their hardest\Nnot when doing it for themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:45.12,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,but when they're doing it for people \Nthey care about more than themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.11,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:55.07,Default,Sakamoto,0,0,0,,Captain Mori…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.70,Default,Raiden,0,0,0,,There's nothing else we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:00.03,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The transport capsule…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:04.78,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The transport capsule! \NWe can use it to save his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.20,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,There should be one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.27,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.54,Default,Both,0,0,0,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:11.44,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:14.92,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We'll switch you to a spare body and then \Nfind a way to repair this one…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.47,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,I've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.18,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Alphon…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:23.09,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,Because I lived…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.60,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,Because I met you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.73,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,Because I was able to live…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:32.92,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,I've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:36.70,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,Instead, I need you to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:39.25,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,Wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:43.20,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,And give a message to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.58,Default,Saijo,0,0,0,,Message from Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:54.55,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Uncle, Major Alphon has asked me \Nto relay this message from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:57.84,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Alphon? Sasha, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:05.39,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Come in… Yamato. This is Earth! \NCommander Yuki Mori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:06.64,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:09.35,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kodai-kun?! Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:10.46,Italic,Kodai,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.57,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kodai-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.70,Italic,Kodai,0,0,0,,Yuki… Commander Mori…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:19.91,Italic,Kodai,0,0,0,,The Yamato is currently at the Dezarium \Nhome planet, battling an enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.99,Italic,Kodai,0,0,0,,What's your situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.86,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,The partisans have risen up and \Ndisabled the Grand Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:29.75,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,But we're unable to\N deactivate the hyperon bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:34.13,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,The only way to stop it is to destroy the \Ncontrol system on the Dezarium home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.13,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,Hey, Invisible Whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:42.59,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,If Sasha's relaying this, \Nyou can hear it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.58,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:48.85,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,Are you so shocked that Mother was lying \Nto you that you don't want to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:52.57,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,I know there's a human in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:56.92,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,A real human who can sacrifice \Nhimself to save his comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:05:01.39,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,Ignore what Mother said! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:04.55,Italic,Ageha,0,0,0,,Sitting there feeling sorry for yourself \Nwon't get you anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.87,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,We understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:15.63,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Tell command HQ that the Yamato \Nwill succeed in its mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.76,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yes. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:21.05,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Lastly, Captain Kodai \Nwishes to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.43,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Commander Mori, Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.19,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:35.84,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I'll make it back, I promise. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:46.07,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting. Hurry… Hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:53.83,Default,Alphon,0,0,0,,At the end, I was able to see \Nyou at your most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:13.32,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,I'll open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:14.90,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Head to the south pole, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:34.91,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,This planet was originally hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.08,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,According to what Sasha said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:40.65,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Mother's main body is at \Nthe core of the hollow space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:46.88,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Mother Dezarium used the phase core \Nto turn this planet into her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:52.04,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,To stop the hyperon bomb, \Nwe'll have to destroy her main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:56.10,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,We'll use the wave motion gun \Nto finish her in a single blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.61,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Sasha is inside the barriers \Nin the hollow space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.38,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,We need to give her a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:02.95,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,They're pushing us back! Shima!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:04.55,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Domon, I just need one second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:05.92,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Shut those guns up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.41,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.34,Default,Rei,0,0,0,,The Invisible Whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.35,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.89,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,I'm shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:30.41,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Glowdias! Full combat speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.68,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Bring us aside the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.29,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,The gate's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:47.74,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Engine Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:50.49,Default,Yamazaki,0,0,0,,It's hopeless! \NThe engines can't take anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:52.74,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:01.13,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Mother is pushing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:03.37,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Yamato! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.63,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:11.77,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,I've been waiting so long…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:14.43,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,for a chance to really go all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.48,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Shut down the phase cells!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.52,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Close all circuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.39,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,My story isn't just something \Nsomeone created.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:33.03,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Now, I too can be…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:36.29,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,Right, Sleeping Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.45,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,So that's Mother Dezarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.08,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,The phase core itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:43.81,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,We've got a lock on Sasha's signal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:46.32,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,She's still inside the barrier \Nin the hollow area's control block!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:50.32,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,All right! After we fire the wave \Nmotion gun, we'll rescue her immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:52.28,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,We'll use the supercharger to reboot…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.90,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You're being deceived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:10:00.87,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Do you think I would put the control block \Nthat protects me outside my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:05.18,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,That girl is inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:22.89,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Even knowing that she's fake, \Nyou still think of that girl as Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:25.99,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,That's why she lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:32.28,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,She knew that if you knew she was inside,\Nyou would hesitate to destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.35,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Are you… Mother Dezarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:38.03,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Yes, man who does not choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:44.22,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You chose to not choose, Susumu Kodai, \Nand found a path outside the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:49.88,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You're a man who will give everything \Nhe has to protect what he treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:53.29,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You truly are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:57.04,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You are human, in that you let your emotions \Nrule you and fail to choose anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:11:02.27,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You tell yourself you have no choice, and \Nslowly float down the river of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:06.45,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,That's why the Dezarium people made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:13.57,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,They made me, who could make the harsh \Nchoices needed to live. To reach paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:18.06,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,The hyperon bomb will soon activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:21.37,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,If you want to let Earth's humanity \Nremain who they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:24.85,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,you'll have to destroy both her and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.66,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,It hurts to choose, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:34.61,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,You don't need to choose. \NThat's why you have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:37.22,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Entrust everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:41.92,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,I shall phase-ify the ship's wave \Nmotion core, the fragment of Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:46.06,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,and pass through the gates of heaven \Nas the people of Archelias did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.52,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,No, Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:51.28,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,If the two phase cores are combined,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:53.62,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,it will open a hole in \Nthe surface of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:56.25,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,A gate will open to the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:58.24,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,but it will destroy this universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.49,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:03.99,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,That's why phase energy is \Ntaboo, but the Dezarium…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.16,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.94,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Kodai! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.00,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.73,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,The countdown's at zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.91,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Why aren't you firing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.38,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha is…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:15.71,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Sasha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:19.47,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Only we need to pass through \Nthe gates of heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:20.30,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:21.47,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,This voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:26.76,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,This universe existed \Nto select the final victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:31.27,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Evolution is attained \Nat the cost of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:34.78,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,No. Evolution is a program \Nthat life was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:38.15,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Only the heart knows \Nthe path it must follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:39.49,Default,Ageha,0,0,0,,Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:44.23,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,A machine that can only \Ndeny emotion and seek efficiency
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:45.66,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,could never understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:48.64,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,This signal… is coming \Nfrom inside Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.00,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,Then, the signal \Nwe've been receiving…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:55.17,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.17,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai will choose \Nthe path that life must take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.18,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Uncle, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:02.59,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:05.60,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,You need to hurry, or the hyperon bomb—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.52,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:24.15,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Accept it, and you need \Nnot suffer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:29.08,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,In the future, \Nyou will continue to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:35.42,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,That is the destiny of man, \Nthe race cursed by love and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.38,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Uncle, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:40.34,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Now, entrust everything to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:42.76,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,and all your pain will cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.32,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Believe in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:45.38,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,This isn't the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.14,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,We'll see each other again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:50.03,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Your element is all we need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.94,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,If we get rid of everything else, \Nwe can complete the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.86,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Analyzer will…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:58.58,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,To the outside of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.49,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,To the heaven where the\Npeople of Archelias traveled!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:05.99,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,If you still think of me as family…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.99,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Believe and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.96,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:12.75,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,My…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:21.72,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:37.35,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You can have this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.58,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,How horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.21,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,The dream of the Dezarium…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:54.80,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,The dream of all humans \Nliving in this universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.50,Italic,Father,0,0,0,,This was the choice of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.46,Italic,Father,0,0,0,,We must accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.60,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:05.02,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,To think your original still existed…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:09.74,Italic,Father,0,0,0,,We will cease to exist in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:12.67,Italic,Father,0,0,0,,But there's still something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:17.35,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,The girl predicted we would do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:22.31,Italic,Father,0,0,0,,We were originally programs, \N created to serve man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.18,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:29.87,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,I never forgot that… \Nbut it feels like it's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:33.81,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Activating supercharger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:34.88,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Chain warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:38.00,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,No! Wave motion shields to maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.54,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,The Yamato will remain here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.67,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I promised her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.84,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I have to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:53.47,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Or she'll be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.49,Default,Yamazaki,0,0,0,,This is the last one we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:09.28,Default,Yamazaki,0,0,0,,We can't take another hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:10.62,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:12.12,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:15.29,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.22,Default,Serizawa,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:10.88,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,The stars are so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.39,Default,Shima,0,0,0,,Because the Witch is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.02,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Is there any signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.46,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,The omnidirectional radar is still down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.23,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,Nothing on any sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:28.88,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,Outlier entropy values \Nare returning to normal, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:34.24,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I'll return control of the Yamato to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.19,0:17:40.60,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I put the ship in danger with \Nmy selfish, mistaken idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:43.93,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,I don't have the right to\Ncommand the Yamato any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.38,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,Floating object sighted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.65,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,What is this stuff? Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:19.99,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,They were lumps of mud \Npretending to be human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:23.89,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard the Yamato \Ndefeated the enemy planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:27.23,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,We can really count on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:48.19,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,With the phase energy cut off, we'll no\Nlonger be able to maintain our forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.19,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,We knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:56.81,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Even if we did so in ignorance, \Nwe still deceived you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:58.62,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:02.27,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Maxim-san, you don't need to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.95,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,The ones who need to apologize are…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.56,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Disappear, mud dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.66,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Don't leave more garbage \Nfor us to pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:18.68,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,Hey, Daddy… did I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:24.34,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,Tsubasa's grandpa said that life \Nisn't about how long you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:28.19,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,If you did what you were supposed \Nto do, you lived enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.99,Default,Frulul,0,0,0,,Did I live…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:35.15,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,You lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.07,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,More than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:42.52,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,You loved enough, and did all \Nyou could for the ones you loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.27,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Someday, everyone will be like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.05,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:54.92,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Tsubasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:56.84,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I can't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:59.14,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I told Frulul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:00.60,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:04.18,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,It's okay, Tsubasa. You can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.69,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Cry, and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:08.23,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Weep a whole life's worth of tears today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:12.57,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Only good things will happen \Nfrom now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:23.39,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,We can't use the supercharger anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:26.59,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,The miracle of Iscandar has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:30.58,Default,Yamazaki,0,0,0,,We've got a lot of work to do before \Nwe catch up to the ancient Archelians.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:33.38,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Do we need to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:37.17,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Only one life form can reach \Nthe highest pinnacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:41.47,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,If what Mother Dezarium said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:46.56,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,I want to punch god for\Nmaking it a contest like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:53.03,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,Man has happiness \Nhe is supposed to find in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:57.39,Default,Yamanami,0,0,0,,We need to make our own utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:58.84,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.17,Default,Sado,0,0,0,,Absolutely everything's in order!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:03.99,Default,Sado,0,0,0,,That's definitely Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:07.58,Default,Niimi,0,0,0,,She lost the memories she had \Nwhen she was synchronized
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.50,Default,Niimi,0,0,0,,with the 17-year-old Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.96,Default,Niimi,0,0,0,,But maybe that's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:19.26,Default,Niimi,0,0,0,,Her life is just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:35.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(1500,1500)\fs15\blur2\3c&H322C29&\pos(49.301,287.889)}Episode 26:\NLove, Until That Day

